            <section class="experience-overview">
              <span class="experience-section-kicker">Context & role</span>
              <h3>Product overview</h3>
              <p>DRIME is a responsive, multilingual, interactive, embeddable video player with no cookies, plus an integrated video editor. It relies on a custom .drime JSON-based format that enables playback in multiple languages (subtitles, voiceovers, dynamic designs) from a single video file. This reduces production time, storage costs, and the ecological footprint associated with file storage (one hosted video per project, one DRIME file per project).</p>
            </section>
