            <section class="no-bg experience-detail-section">
              <span class="experience-section-kicker">01 · Case study</span>
              <h3 class="experience-section-title">DRIME Player & .drime file format</h3>
              <h4>For professionals/clients</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>Video tutorials are filmed by the DRIME team and optimized for all screen resolutions.</li>
                <li>Features include multi-language broadcasting via voiceovers, subtitles, and dynamic designs in all selected languages, plus voice commands. Tutorials/manuals can be broken into step-by-step sequences.</li>
                <li>Beyond the DRIME platform’s video library, clients can embed single videos or entire libraries on their own sites via iframes (indexed by Google).</li>
                <li>The platform includes a dashboard with “Smart Indicators”, user-rights management, custom iframes, and QR codes. Dynamic video designs were also road-mapped.</li>
              </ul>
              <h4>For end users</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>A video playback experience that adapts to screen resolution, with step-by-step or continuous playback, voice commands, sound/subtitle settings, and language selection.</li>
                <li>By default, the video displays in the user’s browser language when available, otherwise in English.</li>
              </ul>
              <h4>Key Achievements — Player</h4>
              <ul>
                <li>Developed new features end to end (front end & back end).</li>
                <li>Player redesign: persistent sound/subtitle settings; CSS & Lottie animations for buttons; step counters for step-by-step videos; improved voice commands.</li>
                <li>Homepage redesign with Lottie animations and menu creation.</li>
                <li>Fixed video creation crashes (>5 videos) by implementing a background job for multilingual generation; later redesigned the pipeline for scalability.</li>
                <li>Created a new library type, redesigned the previous library, and refactored the data model to support custom client designs at scale.</li>
                <li>Built Smart Indicators (library dashboard, rankings, graphs, averages, percentages).</li>
                <li>Fully redesigned user-rights & favorites with a mini search engine (search by email).</li>
                <li>Built a custom iframe generator (logo, banner, menu, filters, forced language, Smart Indicator code copy).</li>
                <li>Built a QR code generator (color, background color, size, format, Smart Indicator, download).</li>
                <li>Redesigned error pages and created static pages (pricing, legal notices, privacy policy).</li>
                <li>Redesigned registration and login pages.</li>
                <li>Implemented multilingual dynamic video designs.</li>
                <li>Built a Super Admin dashboard to create/modify design types, including creating/reading/editing JSON animation files directly.</li>
                <li>Created a second landing page.</li>
